      "text": "This extensive group journey travels through Brazil, Argentina, Chile, Bolivia and Peru. Over 18 days, you will see Rio de Janeiro and Iguazu, Buenos Aires, Santiago and the Atacama Desert, high-altitude lagoons and the Uyuni Salt Flat, La Paz and Lake Titicaca, Cusco, Machu Picchu and Lima.",
